*User drags an object across a screen",
Goal Drag and Forget <drag_from> <drag-to>
.Look at <drag_from>
.Point to <drag_from>
.Click <drag_from> *mouse_down
.Look at <drag_to>
.Drag to <drag_to>
.Cognitive_processor verify cursor over <drag_to>
.Click <drag_to>  *release the mouse
.Ignore <drag_from> <drag_to>
